<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<%- partial('_partial/head') %>
<body>
    <%- partial('_partial/header') %>    
        <main>
        <h2 style="text-align: center; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600;">🧰 我的小工具</h2>
        <p style="text-align: center; color: #64748b; margin: 0 0 2.5rem;">一些为学习和日常使用做的小工具。</p>
        
        <!-- 使用你最熟悉的 CSS Grid 网格布局，自动把专栏排成精美的卡片矩阵！ -->
        <div class="columns-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 1.8rem;">
            <div class="column-card" style="background: white; padding: 2rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border: 1px solid #f1f5f9; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
                <div>
                    <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #0f172a; font-size: 1.3rem;">🔢 数字英语练习</h3>
                    <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 1rem 0 2rem;">随机数字、英文答案和美式英语发音，练习数字的读法与听力。</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <a href="<%- url_for('/tools/number-english-practice/') %>" style="display: inline-block; padding: 0.6rem 1.8rem; background: #3b82f6; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);">
                        打开工具 →
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
    <%- partial('_partial/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
